    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "HWP Estate Agents are delighted to welcome Apartment 22, Killininny Court to the residential property market.\nThis superb two-bedroom ground floor apartment is ideally positioned in this mature and highly sought-after residential development in the heart of Firhouse. Offering bright, well-proportioned accommodation throughout, this property presents an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers, downsizers, or investors alike.\n\nThe accommodation briefly comprises an inviting entrance hall, a spacious open-plan living and dining area filled with natural light, a well-appointed kitchen, a generous double bedroom & one single bedroom, and a main family bathroom. \n\nKillininny Court enjoys an exceptionally convenient location with a host of amenities nearby including SuperValu Firhouse, local cafes, restaurants, parks, and excellent leisure facilities all within less than 5 minutes of walking distance. The area is well serviced by a selection of primary and secondary schools and benefits from excellent public transport links to Dublin City Centre, while the M50 road network is just minutes away providing easy access to all major routes.\n\nThis property combines comfortable living with superb convenience in a well-established and popular Dublin 24 location.\n\nViewing Early is Highly advised"
      },
      {
