        "Content": "Spacious 2-bedroom ground floor apartment\nBright and well-proportioned accommodation\nMature and well-maintained development\nExcellent owner-occupier or investment opportunity\nConvenient and highly sought-after location\nClose to shops, schools, parks, and transport links\nEasy access to the M50 motorway\nDesignated underground parking \n\n\n"
